 {
  id="sha-elemental-mobalytics-tiqqle",
  spec="Elemental",
  label="Elemental · Mobalytics · Tiqqle lv 10-30 21/0/0",
  kind="exact-order",
  default=false,
  note="Exact point order from the guide. Source notes: Typo in the guide's level labels: it says 'Level 15 to 18 - Elemental Alacrity' (4 levels, but the talent maxes at 3) and 'Level 19 to 20 - Call of Flame' (2 levels). The embedded tree shows Elemental Alacrity 3/3 and Call of Flame 3/3, so the order uses 3+3, which means L15-17 and L18-20. All rows and prerequisites check out against the post-Oct-15 tree: Elemental Focus at 11 points, Eye of the S",
  priorities="Level list: L10-14 Convection (mana), Elemental Alacrity (cast time), Call of Flame (Flame Shock duration and Searing Totem), L21 Elemental Focus, L22-24 Concussion, L25-27 Eye of the Storm, L28 Earthbound, L29 Concussion, L30 Lava Burst. The embedded tree matches: Convection 5, Concussion 4, Elemental Alacrity 3, Call of Flame 3, Elemental Focus 1, Eye of the Storm 3, Earthbound 1, Lava Burst 1 (21/0/0). Rotation: Searing Totem, Lava Burst or Lightning Bolt, Flame Shock, Earth or Frost Shock, then melee with Flametongue to save mana. For AoE: Magma Totem, Totemic Projection and Fire Nova. Stats: spell power > intellect > spirit > crit > hit.",
