 {
  id="sha-elemental-wowhead-lucenia",
  spec="Elemental",
  label="Elemental · Wowhead · Lucenia lv 10-30",
  kind="priorities",
  default=false,
  note="Priorities only — no readable allocation. ◆ marks the talents the guide stresses. Source notes: The 'Talents you can now reach' list still includes Call of Thunder, which is not in the verified tree (removed on Oct 15), even though the page says it was updated Oct 24. No allocation can be read, so rows cannot be checked. A reader comment disputes the 'totems aren't useful' reasoning.",
  priorities="Both builds are in calculator embeds that do not show as text. Recommended hybrid leveling build: start in Restoration with Mindfulness and Water Shield for mana, Tidal Focus for hit and Improved Healing Wave (or Totemic Focus), then continue down Elemental for the core talents. Alternative 'Deep Elemental': Elemental Alacrity and Eye of the Storm first for maximum Lightning Bolt casting, at the cost of mana. Legacy bonus points go to Shamanistic Focus, Elemental Weapons and one floating Enhancement point. At this level Fire Nova (boosted by Trial by Fire) is the strongest spell. Use Clearcasting (Elemental Focus) procs on Fire Nova and melee to pool mana.",
